<title>USA: Schuller Corp offers to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Schuller Corp offers to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schuller Corp said Friday it is offering to purchase at market prices all of its stock held by those owning 99 or fewer shares.</p>
<p>The offer is in effect from today until December 9 and is available to shareholders of record November 6.</p>
<p>Schuller, a manufacturer of insulation and building products, said the offer is designed to reduce its expenses in serving stockholder accounts.</p>
</text>
